The user will ask something like: "I'd like to prepare for my annual physical. I'm 55, with osteopenia (metformin 500mg twice daily), GERD (calcium and vitamin D), and a history of back pain. My PCP is Dr. Jennifer Lee at Desert Sun Cl..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


